  "body": "Welcome to your renovated family retreat—designed for those who value space, style, and effortless living. This thoughtfully updated home offers everything you need to create lasting memories and enjoy every moment.\r\n\r\nKey Features at a Glance:\r\n• 3 Spacious Bedrooms – Ideal for growing families, guests, or a dedicated home office  \r\n• 2 Modern Bathrooms– Enjoy comfort and convenience for busy mornings and relaxing evenings  \r\n• Sun-Drenched Living Area & Conservatory** – Perfect for family gatherings, quiet mornings, or unwinding with a good book  \r\n• Contemporary Kitchen – Entertain with ease and savour everyday living  \r\n• Single Internal Access Garage + 3 Off-Street Parking Spaces** – Plenty of room for family and visitors  \r\n• Large, Private Garden Sanctuary** – Safe play for kids, space for pets, and the ultimate backdrop for summer barbecues  \r\n\r\nA Location Your Family Will Love:\r\n• Zoned for Outstanding Schools: Pakuranga College, Farm Cove Intermediate, and Wakaaranga Primary  \r\n• Everything Close By: Walk to local schools, parks, shopping, and convenient bus stops  \r\n• Easy City Access:** Quick commute via the ferry at Half Moon Bay Marina—perfect for work or weekend adventures\r\n\r\nImagine a Home Where:\r\n• Your children attend excellent schools  \r\n• You relax in your sunlit conservatory  \r\n• Friends and family always have space to visit  \r\n• You’re minutes from everything you need  \r\n\r\nReady to Start Your Next Chapter?\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing. Let us help you secure a home where comfort, connection, and convenience come together—because your family deserves nothing less.\r\n\r\nYour trusted partner in finding the perfect place to call home.",
